<ModOps>

	<!-- Oriental Lighthouse monument: IAAM's lighthouse models (buildings/orient/lighthouse) as construction stages.
	     Stage 1 Nomad goods, stage 2 Envoy goods, stage 3 late Envoy goods, then the completed lighthouse
	     (HarborOffice template, like vanilla's tourist monument turning into a TowerRestaurant) with one socket for
	     any ship or airship item; assets_lighthouse_beacons.xml applies the socketed item to all ships.
	     One per island: BuildingUnique on the stages, triggers/assets_lighthouse_unique.xml for the completed one.
	     Harbour placement like the harbour tower 1404004801: Water_Including_Coast, Orient (New World) quay, QuayArea over the
	     whole BuildBlocker in the stage .ifo files, terrain-height adaption off in the cfgs. -->

